<title>USA: Tri Polyta ends at 8 in New York.</title>
<headline>Tri Polyta ends at 8 in New York.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Tri Polyta Indonesia closed at 8 in New York on Tuesday. It recorded the day's high of 8-1/4 and the day's low 7-3/4.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Friday was 8-1/4.</p>
<p>Volume on Tuesday was 72,300 American Depository Shares (ADS).</p>
<p>Block volume was 40,000.</p>
<p>One ADS represents 10 common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364)</p>
</text>
